{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ShiNingCloud Studio Presents\uff01</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686170/extras/gif2.gif?t=1748146134\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an ARPG game that integrates Action + Loot + Role Development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It has a powerful combat system, Deflecting, Parrying, Blocking, Dash, Offset. And the unique Deflecting-Suppression-OVERTAKE system gives you an Unprecedented action interaction experience. Say Goodbye to boring souls-like combat Now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Except the super cool actions, this game also has a Diablo2-like role development.  Allocate your attributes, talents freely and loot drops. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Higher the difficulty, better the drops!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014   </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">If you find bugs or have any suggestion, feel free to contact me. You can send an email or leave me a message on bilibili.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Good Luck &amp; Have Fun!</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686170?t=1748146134","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686170/4bae883020f21b2940f3efb866f6190df0bcfc3b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748146134","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686170/1d55f5fa53680567928fb564c8aaff6fb33d6111/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748146134","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686170/1d55f5fa53680567928fb564c8aaff6fb33d6111/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748146134","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descript